Agreed by Kenneth, 2026-11-05 (“Yes, keep it”): printers JusPrin already has are listed as “Already in JusPrin” and skipped (02, 04), because the import as built saves a second copy, “… (Orca copy)”, of anything whose name JusPrin already has. No folder found offers Choose the folder… (05).

Also agreed the same day (“Yes, keep it”): the import doesn’t change the printer the open project uses (03)."}

