content.text:
I started [Build linked printer setup: JusPrin 1, OrcaSlicer, manual](#local_e1a9cfc9-0078-44b4-8deb-e6a73daf009a). It works from canvas version 149, in its own worktree on a branch cut from ui-walkthrough, and won't push.

It will:
- turn the JusPrin 1 import into a screen that asks first, reusing the OrcaSlicer import's code;
- remove the welcome-back window and the subscriber price line;
- put the "Other ways" links and folder pickers on all three printer screens;
- add File › Import › Import from JusPrin 1…;
- look for OrcaSlicer in Flatpak and portable installs.

When it's done, I'll check its screenshots and changes myself before telling you it works.

